---
import LeadForm from './LeadForm';
import { getBrokers, twinsSortedByTer } from '../lib/pairs';
import { formatTer } from '../lib/format';

const twins = twinsSortedByTer('sp500');
const broker = getBrokers()[0];
const steps = broker.steps.value.slice(0, 3);
---
<section id="navod" data-section="navod" class="section guide">
  <h2>Co je v návodu</h2>
  <p class="guide__sub">PDF, 3–4 strany. Pošleme ho na váš e-mail po jeho potvrzení.</p>

  <!-- Stylised pages in HTML (real text, no images); decorative, the list below says the same. -->
  <div class="guide__pages" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="page">
      <p class="page__title">Jak koupit S&amp;P 500 a další americké indexy u XTB, Trading 212, Fio a Degiro</p>
      <table class="page__table">
        <tbody>
          {twins.map((f) => (
            <tr>
              <td class="page__tk">{f.id}</td>
              <td class="page__num">{formatTer(f.ter.value)}</td>
              <td class="page__num">{f.isin.value}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="page__lines"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="page page--2">
      <p class="page__title">{broker.name}: postup krok za krokem</p>
      {steps.length > 0 && (
        <ol class="page__steps">
          {steps.map((s) => <li>{s}</li>)}
        </ol>
      )}
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul class="guide__list">
    <li>Pro XTB, Trading 212, Fio a Degiro: poplatek za nákup a postup krok za krokem. Která dvojčata broker nabízí, s ISIN a tickerem k vyhledání, uvádíme tam, kde jsme to u brokera ověřili.</li>
    <li>Tabulka všech párů originál → dvojče s TER a ISIN.</li>
    <li>Akumulace vs. distribuce a co to znamená pro daně v ČR (časový test).</li>
    <li>Údaje o brokerech ověřujeme na jejich stránkách; datum ověření je uvedené v návodu.</li>
  </ul>

  <LeadForm client:visible placement="preview" pair="sp500" />
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use '../styles/tokens' as *;

  .guide__sub {
    margin: -$s2 0 $s4;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  // Two A4 sheets side by side, the second overlapping slightly and set $s3 lower.
  .guide__pages {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin: 0 0 $s4;
    padding-bottom: $s3;
  }

  .page {
    flex: none;
    width: 44%;
    aspect-ratio: 210 / 297;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 7% 6%;
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    font-size: 8px;
    line-height: 1.35;

    p { margin: 0; }

    &--2 {
      position: relative;
      margin: $s3 0 0 -4%;
    }
  }

  .page__title {
    margin-bottom: 0.9em !important;
    font-size: 8px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .page__table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 7px;

    td {
      padding: 0.35em 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  }

  .page__tk,
  .page__num {
    font-family: $font-mono;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .page__tk { font-weight: 600; }
  .page__num { text-align: right; padding-left: 0.6em !important; }

  // Body-copy placeholder strokes below the table (the text would be too small to read anyway).
  .page__lines {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7em;
    margin-top: 1.2em;

    span { display: block; height: 1px; background: var(--rule); }
    span:nth-child(2n) { width: 82%; }
  }

  .page__steps {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.3em;
    font-size: 7px;
    line-height: 1.4;

    li + li { margin-top: 0.5em; }
    li::marker { font-family: $font-mono; font-weight: 600; }
  }

  .guide__list {
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 0 0 $s4;
    padding-left: 1.1em;

    li { padding-left: $s1; text-wrap: pretty; }
    li + li { margin-top: $s2; }
    li::marker { color: var(--signal); }
  }

  .guide :global(.lead-form) { max-width: none; }
</style>
